      "content": "hey i just got back from singapore to london (huge flight lol) and i feel kinda weird. my breathing is a bit shallow and it's kinda hard to take a deep breath, and my right calf is really sore and tight. is this just like travel fatigue or jet lag?? i'm exhausted",
